<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>纽约时报 &amp;gt; 美国 &amp;gt; 政治</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/spotlight/on-politics</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 22:28:35 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>中期选举前的经济状况：通胀上升和人工智能的不安</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/21/us/politics/midterm-elections-economy.html</link><description>为什么目前的情况感觉如此奇怪，以及这在 11 月意味着什么。</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 22:28:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/21/us/politics/midterm-elections-economy.html</guid></item><item><title>选民称共和党现在是“精英”政党</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/18/us/politics/republicans-elitist-party-voters-poll.html</link><description>我们采访了对特朗普感到不满的独立人士。</description><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 22:16:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/18/us/politics/republicans-elitist-party-voters-poll.html</guid></item><item><title>这是中期冲刺指南</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/16/us/politics/trump-midterms-senate-map.html</link><description>我们分析一下比赛的状况。</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 23:00:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/16/us/politics/trump-midterms-senate-map.html</guid></item><item><title>JD Vance 为什么要在红色州堪萨斯州进行竞选活动？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/14/us/politics/jd-vance-kansas-campaign-midterms.html</link><description>JD Vance 为什么要在红色州竞选？</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 14:38:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/14/us/politics/jd-vance-kansas-campaign-midterms.html</guid></item><item><title>关于人工智能的严厉警告会影响中期选举吗？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/11/us/politics/midterm-elections-trump-ai.html</link><description>人工智能研究人员的严厉警告在全国引起反响。</description><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 22:21:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/11/us/politics/midterm-elections-trump-ai.html</guid></item><item><title>特朗普有多关心谁赢得中期选举？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/09/us/politics/trump-midterm-strategy.html</link><description>特朗普总统的大会已在达拉斯开幕，因此我们请玛吉·哈伯曼帮助理解他的中期战略。</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 22:39:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/09/us/politics/trump-midterm-strategy.html</guid></item><item><title>关于特朗普阻止邮寄选票的努力需要了解什么</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/04/us/politics/trump-mail-in-ballots-voting-midterms-elections.html</link><description>距选举日不到两个月，我们对拟议的变更和法庭挑战进行了整理。</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 21:24:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/04/us/politics/trump-mail-in-ballots-voting-midterms-elections.html</guid></item><item><title>中期选举，Nepo-Baby 攻击会奏效吗？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/02/us/politics/midterms-nepo-baby-shaheen.html</link><description>一位新罕布什尔州参议员的女儿正在竞选公职，却发现自己的名字被用来对付她。</description><pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 22:55:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/02/us/politics/midterms-nepo-baby-shaheen.html</guid></item><item><title>斯科特·布朗是共和党明星。这在新罕布什尔州参议院竞选中重要吗？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/31/us/politics/new-hampshire-senate-scott-brown.html</link><description>斯科特·布朗（Scott Brown）通过一场看似即兴的参议院竞选活动再次追逐政治聚光灯。</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 22:17:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/31/us/politics/new-hampshire-senate-scott-brown.html</guid></item><item><title>现在是特朗普的首都，但选民并不住在那里</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/28/us/politics/trump-washington-dc-capital-voters.html</link><description>他对重塑华盛顿的痴迷可能会在政治上损害他的政党。</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 14:32:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/28/us/politics/trump-washington-dc-capital-voters.html</guid></item></channel></rss>